</section><section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwATI" aria-labelledby="Groups_containing_oxygen"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Groups_containing_oxygen">Groups containing oxygen</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Functional_group&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: Groups containing oxygen"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwATM">Compounds that contain C–O bonds each possess differing reactivity based upon the location and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orbital_hybridisation" title="Orbital hybridisation" id="mwATQ">hybridization</a> of the C–O bond, owing to the electron-withdrawing effect of sp²-hybridized oxygen (carbonyl groups) and the donating effects of sp³-hybridized oxygen (alcohol groups).</p>
<table class="wikitable skin-invert-image" id="mwATU">
<tbody id="mwATY"><tr id="mwATc">
<th id="mwATg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chemical_class" title="Chemical class" class="mw-redirect" id="mwATk">Chemical class</a></th>
<th id="mwATo">Group</th>
<th id="mwATs">Formula</th>
<th id="mwATw">Structural formula</th>
<th id="mwAT0">Prefix</th>
<th id="mwAT4">Suffix</th>
<th id="mwAT8">Example</th></tr>
<tr id="mwAUA">
<td id="mwAUE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alcohol_(chemistry)" title="Alcohol (chemistry)" id="mwAUI">Alcohol</a>
 </td><td id="mwAUM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hydroxyl" title="Hydroxyl" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAUQ">Hydroxy</a></td>
<td id="mwAUU">ROH</td>
<td id="mwAUY"><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File" id="mwAUc"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Hydroxy-group-bw.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="Hydroxyl" id="mwAUg"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Hydroxy-group-bw.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Hydroxy-group-bw.svg/60px-Hydroxy-group-bw.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Hydroxy-group-bw.svg/120px-Hydroxy-group-bw.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Hydroxyl" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="252" data-file-type="drawing" height="30" width="60" class="mw-file-element" id="mwAUk"/></a><figcaption id="mwAUo">Hydroxyl</figcaption></figure></td>
<td id="mwAUs">hydroxy-</td><td id="mwAUw"><b id="mwAU0">-ol</b></td>
<td id="mwAU4"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwAU8" data-mw='{"caption":"methanol"}'><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Methanol-2D.svg" class="mw-file-description" title="methanol" id="mwAVA"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Methanol-2D.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Methanol-2D.svg/120px-Methanol-2D.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Methanol-2D.svg/250px-Methanol-2D.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="methanol" data-file-width="1100" data-file-height="938" data-file-type="drawing" height="77" width="90" class="mw-file-element" id="mwAVE"/></a></span><br id="mwAVI"/><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Methanol" title="Methanol" id="mwAVM">Methanol</a></td></tr>
<tr id="mwAVQ">
