</section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mwAr0" aria-labelledby="Groups_containing_nitrogen"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Groups_containing_nitrogen">Groups containing nitrogen</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Functional_group&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Groups containing nitrogen"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAr4">Compounds that contain nitrogen in this category may contain C-O bonds, such as in the case of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amide" title="Amide" id="mwAr8">amides</a>.</p>
