</section><section data-mw-section-id="7" id="mwBmQ" aria-labelledby="Groups_containing_phosphorus"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Groups_containing_phosphorus">Groups containing phosphorus</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Functional_group&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7" title="Edit section: Groups containing phosphorus"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwBmU">Compounds that contain phosphorus exhibit unique chemistry due to the ability of phosphorus to form more bonds than nitrogen, its lighter analogue on the periodic table.</p>
<table class="wikitable skin-invert-image" id="mwBmY">
<tbody id="mwBmc"><tr id="mwBmg">
<th id="mwBmk"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chemical_class" title="Chemical class" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBmo">Chemical class</a></th>
<th id="mwBms">Group</th>
<th id="mwBmw">Formula</th>
<th id="mwBm0">Structural formula</th>
